@Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

### Register (201 created, 409 on duplicate control number)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "controlNumber": "s900",
  "fullName": "Prueba Local",
  "email": "prueba@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### Login (200 with token, 401 bad credentials, 403 pending)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "controlNumber": "s900",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### Me (needs Authorization: Bearer <token>)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Accept: application/json

###

### Admin: pending registrations (needs Administrator role)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users/pending
Accept: application/json

###

### Topics (authenticated)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/topics
Accept: application/json

###

### Create topic (Administrator)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tema de prueba",
  "description": "Descripción",
  "orderNumber": 7
}

###

### Create session (Administrator; topicIds from GET /api/topics)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sesión 1",
  "description": "Primera sesión",
  "sessionDate": "2026-10-01T18:00:00Z",
  "topicIds": []
}

###

### Regenerate session QR (Administrator)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/sessions/{sessionId}/qr/regenerate
Accept: application/json

###

### Download session QR PNG (Administrator)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/sessions/{sessionId}/qr/image
Accept: image/png

###

### Register attendance by QR (authenticated student)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/qr/{token}
Accept: application/json

###

### Session attendance list (Administrator)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/sessions/{sessionId}/attendance
Accept: application/json

###
